{"name":"Tropical Smoothie","hex":"#c5556d","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"tropical","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of or pertaining to the tropics, the equatorial region between 23 degrees north and 23 degrees south.","From, or similar to, a hot, humid climate."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A tropical plant."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/tropical"},{"term":"smoothie","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A smooth-talking person.","A drink made from whole fruit, thus thicker than fruit juice."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/smoothie"}],"entries":[{"title":"Tropical Smoothie Cafe","blocks":[{"text":"Tropical Smoothie Cafe, also referred to as Tropical Smoothie, is a restaurant franchise in the United States. It operates more than 1750 locations nationwide."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tropical_Smoothie_Cafe"},{"title":"Tropics","blocks":[{"text":"The tropics are the region of Earth surrounding the equator, where the Sun may shine directly overhead. This contrasts with the temperate or polar regions of Earth, where the Sun can never be directly overhead. Because of Earth's axial tilt, the width of the tropics is twice the tilt. The tropics are also referred to as the tropical zone and the torrid zone."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/World_map_indicating_tropics_and_subtropics.png/330px-World_map_indicating_tropics_and_subtropics.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tropics"},{"title":"Smoothie","blocks":[{"text":"A smoothie is a beverage made by puréeing ingredients in a blender. A smoothie commonly has a liquid base, such as fruit juice, milk, yogurt, or ice cream. Other ingredients may be added, including fruits, vegetables, non-dairy milk, crushed ice, spices, herbs, sweetener, whey powder, or nutritional supplements."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Kiwi_Smoothie.jpg/330px-Kiwi_Smoothie.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smoothie"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/Tropical_Smoothie_Cafe_-_Island_Green_smoothie%2C_June_2018.jpg/500px-Tropical_Smoothie_Cafe_-_Island_Green_smoothie%2C_June_2018.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/Tropical_Smoothie_Cafe_-_Island_Green_smoothie%2C_June_2018.jpg/1280px-Tropical_Smoothie_Cafe_-_Island_Green_smoothie%2C_June_2018.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/Tropical_Smoothie_Cafe_-_Island_Green_smoothie%2C_June_2018.jpg/500px-Tropical_Smoothie_Cafe_-_Island_Green_smoothie%2C_June_2018.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Tropical Smoothie Cafe's Island Green smoothie","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATropical_Smoothie_Cafe_-_Island_Green_smoothie%2C_June_2018.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/Interior_view%2C_Tropical_Smoothie_Cafe%2C_Belle_Haven.jpg/500px-Interior_view%2C_Tropical_Smoothie_Cafe%2C_Belle_Haven.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/Interior_view%2C_Tropical_Smoothie_Cafe%2C_Belle_Haven.jpg/1280px-Interior_view%2C_Tropical_Smoothie_Cafe%2C_Belle_Haven.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/Interior_view%2C_Tropical_Smoothie_Cafe%2C_Belle_Haven.jpg/500px-Interior_view%2C_Tropical_Smoothie_Cafe%2C_Belle_Haven.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Interior of a Tropical Smoo